Open_Notebook

This project implements a new application architecture for SenseNova-powered
document-to-visual workflows. It was designed with reference to local materials
provided by the project owner:

- Clouds_Coder.py: LLM profile configuration and provider-selection behavior.
- SenseNova-U1-main: SenseNova-U1 local inference concepts and resolution buckets.
- SenseNova-Skills-main: SenseNova image, infographic, and PPT workflow contracts.

No SenseNova model weights, generated showcase images, private API keys, or
large upstream source files are redistributed in this repository.

